# ScatterPlotChart

## Overview

ScatterPlotChart is a top-level compound chart component that composes `ChartHeader`, `ChartLegend`, `DataDisplay`, `ScatterPlotGroup`, and `ChartFooter` into a complete scatter plot visualization. It follows the **Organized Props Pattern** with two layers: Parent Props and Child Configs.

Unlike category-based charts, ScatterPlotChart uses `ScatterPlotDataPoint[]` with numeric (x, y) coordinates and optional `series` grouping. Both axes are linear numeric scales driven by D3.

All visual tokens are resolved through the **CSS cascade** — no Figma variable resolver runs at render time. Categorical colors reference `--DataVis-Categorical-Bold-{n}` CSS custom properties injected by the DataVis pipeline (`generateDataVisCSS` → `useStyleInjection`). Layout spacing uses `var(--Spacing-5)` from the OneUI token cascade.

## Figma Reference

- **Node ID**: `852:65909`
- **Design File**: DataVis-Components
- **Figma URL**: https://www.figma.com/design/uA5ExvS0cNXbDEKzT9Rnrt/DataVis-Components?node-id=852-65909

## Architecture

```
ScatterPlotChart (flex-column container, gap: var(--Spacing-5))
├── ChartAccessibility (role="figure", liveText region, hidden data table)
│   ├── ChartHeader (ChartTitle + ChartSubtitle)
│   ├── ChartLegend (optional, up to 6 ChartKey items)
│   ├── DataDisplay (optional, static KPI display, id=dataDisplayId)
│   │   ├── mainLabel (typography tokens from CSS cascade)
│   │   ├── DataHead (DataLead + SupportingData + SupportingLabel)
│   │   └── Badge (change indicator, via showBadge + badgeConfig)
│   ├── ScatterPlotGroup (D3 linear scales, SVG circles)
│   │   ├── YAxis (numeric tick positioning from D3 scale)
│   │   ├── contentWrapper
│   │   │   ├── plotWrapper
│   │   │   │   ├── <svg> (SVG <circle> elements, aria-hidden)
│   │   │   │   └── focus overlay (role="group") [interactive only]
│   │   │   │       ├── <div role="button"> per data point (keyboard only, pointerEvents: none)
│   │   │   │       └── proximity overlay (aria-hidden, Delaunay.find) [mouse events]
│   │   │   └── XAxis (numeric tick positioning from D3 scale)
│   │   └── HoverBadge (cursor-following tooltip) [hoverBadge + interactive only]
│   └── ChartFooter (source + notes — typography tokens from CSS cascade)
```

## Import

```tsx
import { ScatterPlotChart } from '@oneui/datavis';
```

Or via direct path (better build performance):

```tsx
import { ScatterPlotChart } from '@oneui/datavis/components/charts/ScatterPlotChart';
```

## Data Format

### ScatterPlotDataPoint

```typescript
interface ScatterPlotDataPoint {
  id?: string;          // Stable React key
  x: number;            // X-axis value
  y: number;            // Y-axis value
  size?: number;        // Drives per-dot radius via d3.scaleSqrt when present
  series?: string;      // Series grouping (assigns categorical color)
  label?: string;       // Point label (for accessibility data table)
  color?: string;       // Direct color override
  colorIndex?: number;  // Explicit categorical color index (1-based, clamped 1–12)
}
```

### Single-Series Example

```typescript
const data: ScatterPlotDataPoint[] = [
  { id: 'p1', x: 10, y: 45 },
  { id: 'p2', x: 25, y: 60 },
  { id: 'p3', x: 40, y: 72 },
];
```

### Multi-Series Example

```typescript
const data: ScatterPlotDataPoint[] = [
  { id: 'a1', x: 10, y: 25, series: 'North' },
  { id: 'a2', x: 30, y: 52, series: 'North' },
  { id: 'b1', x: 15, y: 35, series: 'South' },
  { id: 'b2', x: 35, y: 55, series: 'South' },
];
```

## Props Interface

```typescript
interface ScatterPlotChartProps {
  data?: ScatterPlotDataPoint[];
  width?: number | string;
  height?: number | string;
  fullWidth?: boolean;
  chartHeader?: boolean;
  chartFooter?: boolean;
  chartLegend?: boolean;
  dataDisplay?: boolean;
  animated?: boolean;
  interactive?: boolean;
  onDotHover?: (hoverData: ScatterPlotHoverData) => void;

