## Performance Notes

- Uses `useMemo` for legend generation and series detection
- `getCategoricalColor` is stable via `useCallback` with an empty dependency array — it returns a CSS var string, no token resolution at call time
- ScatterPlotGroup handles all D3 calculations with internal memoization
- Container gap uses `var(--Spacing-5)` as an inline CSS var string — zero JS involved in spacing resolution

